<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia December inflation up to 8.8 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia December inflation up to 8.8 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p>CONSUMER PRICE INFLATION</p>
<p>    (changes in percent)	     Dec	  Nov	 Dec 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	    0.7	  0.4	  0.6</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change		8.8	  8.6	  8.6 --</p>
<p>Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
